B.ecv=new A.cZ("h1",B.lX,"Love feels safe","Healthy love feels safe. You can disagree, say no, see friends and family, and still be loved. Respect is not a reward \u2014 it\u2019s the floor.","",B.xR)
B.ebP=new A.cZ("h2",B.lX,"Love doesn\u2019t control","Checking your phone, controlling who you see, threats, or making you afraid are not signs of love. They are warning signs, whatever the reason given.","",B.xR)
B.eLn=s(["space","calm"],t.s)
B.ebI=new A.cZ("h3",B.lX,"Boundaries are care",'Boundaries aren\u2019t walls \u2014 they tell the person you love how to love you well. "I need a little time to think" is a healthy thing to say.',"",B.eLn)
